# Copy to .env.local for local dev (with `supabase start` running, these
# match its printed output) or fill in from your Supabase project settings.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Server-only. NEVER prefix this with NEXT_PUBLIC_, never import it from
# client code — it bypasses RLS entirely. Not used by the app itself today
# (no admin/seeding server code needs it yet); kept here so its absence is a
# deliberate, visible choice rather than something added quietly later.
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=

# Server-only — the shared bar-tablet's Supabase Auth account. src/middleware.ts
# signs in as this account (server-side, via cookies) when a bar-shell request
# has no session yet. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md → "Shared bar-tablet session
# mechanism" and issue #32. Provisioning this account in Supabase itself is a
# manual ops step (Studio/CLI), not something the app does.
# SUPABASE_DEVICE_EMAIL=
# SUPABASE_DEVICE_PASSWORD=
